WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.505 --> 00:00:02.457
- [Narrator] Should I say hi?

00:00:02.457 --> 00:00:04.051
I don't wanna interact.

00:00:04.051 --> 00:00:07.182
No one's paying attention, I
don't need to say anything.

00:00:07.182 --> 00:00:10.432
But does that make me look anti-social?

00:00:14.465 --> 00:00:18.202
Please don't sit next
to me, please don't sit.

00:00:18.202 --> 00:00:20.160
Why is having another
person sit next to me

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:21.951
so uncomfortable?

00:00:21.951 --> 00:00:26.290
I feel like they're too
close not to interact.

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:29.457
Shit, now we just stand here silently.

00:00:31.015 --> 00:00:34.565
Oh god this is so awkward,
do I say something?

00:00:34.565 --> 00:00:37.398
I'll just watch the floors change.

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:40.697
I'll go later.

00:00:44.408 --> 00:00:45.241
K? Just K?

00:00:47.266 --> 00:00:49.091
Did I say something wrong?

00:00:49.091 --> 00:00:51.212
Maybe she wants to have lunch later?

00:00:51.212 --> 00:00:52.922
- Go ahead and tell the team your idea.

00:00:52.922 --> 00:00:54.512
- [Narrator] Everyone's looking at me.

00:00:54.512 --> 00:00:56.218
My heart is pounding.

00:00:56.218 --> 00:00:58.008
They can probably tell I'm nervous.

00:00:58.008 --> 00:01:00.043
Ah, that's so embarrassing.

00:01:00.043 --> 00:01:01.632
- Hey come meet the new hire.

00:01:01.632 --> 00:01:02.911
- [Narrator] Do I go for a handshake?

00:01:02.911 --> 00:01:03.744
A hug? Do I just wave?

00:01:03.744 --> 00:01:07.350
- Oh hey, do you wanna come out tonight?

00:01:07.350 --> 00:01:08.528
Everyone's going.

00:01:08.528 --> 00:01:10.864
- [Narrator] Ah, I think
I'm just gonna go home.

00:01:10.864 --> 00:01:11.697
- Ah lame.

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:14.286
- [Narrator] God, I am lame.

00:01:14.286 --> 00:01:18.935
They probably hate me,
think I'm super anti-social.

00:01:18.935 --> 00:01:20.078
When do I wave?

00:01:20.078 --> 00:01:21.160
Am I too far to wave?

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:23.969
I think my palms are sweating.

00:01:23.969 --> 00:01:24.802
Hi.

00:01:24.802 --> 00:01:26.574
- It was so great catching up with you,

00:01:26.574 --> 00:01:28.112
I'll see ya later.

00:01:28.112 --> 00:01:30.026
- Wow, that was nice.

00:01:30.026 --> 00:01:32.526
I really think that went okay.

00:01:33.361 --> 00:01:35.778
(soft music)

